# T-1154: VarRef in pattern position is a pin (equality check) or wildcard (if not in scope).
# Unresolved VarRefs in dict patterns act as wildcards — arm fires but no name is bound.
# Use 3-arg [case [let b] [b: b] [+ b b]] to bind the field and double it.
[match [a: 1 b: 2]
  [case [let b] [b: b] [+ b b]]
  ...: 0]

=== out
Int(4)
